OL,3,ACultural treasures are being destroyed
OL,4,Aworldwide - so why is no-one being
OL,5,Apunished?
OL,6,
OL,7,FCultural treasures are being destroyed
OL,8,Fworldwide - so why is no-one being
OL,9,Fpunished?
OL,11,FAugust was a brutal month for Ukraine.
OL,12,FRussian aerial attacks increased
OL,13,Fsignificantly, launching thousands of
OL,14,Fdrones. Kyiv was intensely bombarded,
OL,15,Fas were the southern cities of Mykolaiv
OL,16,Fand Odesa. Amid the destruction and
OL,17,Floss of life, Odesa reported damage to
OL,18,Fsix Unesco-protected sites, including
OL,19,Fthe salmon-pink 19th Century Alexandru
OL,20,FSturdza House.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
