OL,3,ACultural treasures are being destroyed
OL,4,Aworldwide - so why is no-one being
OL,5,Apunished?
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt raised again the question of why it
OL,8,Fis so hard to hold actors accountable
OL,9,Ffor the destruction of buildings and
OL,10,Fobjects with real cultural
OL,11,Fsignificance.
OL,13,FIn the last month alone, Ukraine's
OL,14,FMinistry of Culture reported that 148
OL,15,Fcultural heritage sites were recorded
OL,16,Fas damaged or destroyed, including in
OL,17,FOdesa.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
